# Newsletter emails saved for the parser. These stay on your own computer:
# an email carries unsubscribe links tied to your address, and those do not
# belong in a public repository. Only the parsed result (data/events-email.js)
# is committed. See tools/README.md.
data/email-drop/*
!data/email-drop/README.md
